2026-01-21 18:40:01.508|INFO||org.kie.kogito.testcontainers.KogitoGenericContainer|STDERR: INFO  2026-01-22 02:40:01,394 [shard 0:main] main - application.cc:852 - redpanda.partition_autobalancing_min_size_threshold:{nullopt}	- Minimum size of partition that is going to be prioritized when rebalancing a cluster due to the disk size threshold being breached. This value is calculated automatically by default.
