18:46:33.044 [docker-java-stream-729826801] INFO  org.kie.kogito.testcontainers.KogitoGenericContainer - STDERR: INFO  2026-01-22 02:46:33,040 [shard 0:main] main - application.cc:852 - redpanda.alive_timeout_ms:5000	- The amount of time since the last broker status heartbeat. After this time, a broker is considered offline and not alive.
