18:46:33.053 [docker-java-stream-729826801] INFO  org.kie.kogito.testcontainers.KogitoGenericContainer - STDERR: INFO  2026-01-22 02:46:33,040 [shard 0:main] main - application.cc:852 - redpanda.cloud_storage_azure_hierarchical_namespace_enabled:{nullopt}	- Whether or not an Azure hierarchical namespace is enabled on the `cloud_storage_azure_storage_account`. If this property is not set, ´cloud_storage_azure_shared_key` must be set, and each node tries to determine at startup if a hierarchical namespace is enabled. Setting this property to `true` disables the check and treats a hierarchical namespace as active. Setting to `false` disables the check and treats a hierarchical namespace as not active.
